embyToLocalPlayer (modified distribution)

Original project: https://github.com/kjtsune/embyToLocalPlayer
Original author: kjtsune and contributors.

This distribution is a modified version maintained by Tangerinell.
It is not an official release of the upstream project.

Changes made:
- Fixed mpv/Emby playlist entries showing stream URLs instead of episode titles.
- Playlist entries are now added through generated M3U files with #EXTINF titles,
  while per-episode subtitle/chapter options are applied through the mpv IPC API.
- Improved episode title generation when Emby metadata or episodesInfo is incomplete.
- Removed the automatic update script and its launcher menu entry.
- Added local startup helper and packaging/compliance notes.

